  "changes": [
    "Independently authenticate exact committed zone harness edits; retain historical browser source and after-ledger images as local Git comparison DATA only",
    "Actual source/proposal/owner entry establishes zone cold before supplied callbacks and zone physical final after later callbacks",
    "Matching genuine complete child node consumed once per actual binding operation, with full physical preflight/final; opaque/mismatched fallback remains original two full guards",
    "Binding reentry lock uses actual metadata reader identity and recovers in finally; valid child/narrow frame entry after child consume is retained"
  ],
  "contract": "Global callback-free cold and final sweeps plus per-member fresh physical/provided/physical consumption. No new current-byte, parsed-source, verdict or receipt caches; no historical reader grant; no merging independently constructed objects. No guarantee of detecting a cross-member mutation restored by a later callback before the final sweep. No hostile-filesystem atomicity claim.",
